englishDefinition:
Senses relating to caring for or waiting on someone, or accompanying or being present.
 To care for (someone requiring attention); specifically, of a doctor, nurse, etc.: to provide professional care to (someone).

 To wait on (someone or their instructions) as an attendant, servant, etc.; also (specifically of a gentleman-in-waiting or lady-in-waiting to a member of royalty), to accompany (someone) in order to assist or wait upon them; to escort. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}
